sequenceDiagram
    actor Logistics
    participant API as Resource API
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant Outbox as Notification Outbox
    Logistics->>API: POST /api/resources/allocate
    API->>SQL: Begin SERIALIZABLE transaction
    API->>SQL: Check human approval and stock
    alt Enough suitable stock
      API->>SQL: Decrement stock + reserve + audit
      API->>SQL: Write outbox event key
      SQL-->>API: Commit
      API-->>Logistics: 200 reservation
      Outbox->>SQL: Read pending event
      Outbox-->>Outbox: SMTP attempt or in-app-only
    else Shortage or conflict
      API-->>Logistics: 409 Conflict + reason
    end
